tatus="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>JAPAN STORAGE BATTERY CO., LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SAKAMOTO, HIROMI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YOSHIDA, MASAHIRO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YOSHIKAWA, TOMOYA</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>EZAKI SHINGO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SAKAMOTO HIROMI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YOSHIDA MASAHIRO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YOSHIKAWA TOMOYA</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>EZAKI, SHINGO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SAKAMOTO, HIROMI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YOSHIDA, MASAHIRO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YOSHIKAWA, TOMOYA</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A silent discharge tube having a structure in which an inner tube is disposed in an outer tube and having a small power consumption and a long life.  The silent discharge tube comprises a discharge enclosure which has an outer tube and an inner tube provided inside the outer tube and in which a discharge gas is sealed in the space defined between the outer and inner tubes, an outer electrode provided on the outer surface of the outer tube, and an inner electrode provided on the inner surface of the inner tube wherein either the outer electrode or the inner electrode extends over the whole periphery of the tube, and the other extends over part of the periphery, thereby causing discharge at a part of the tube periphery.  At the end of the life of the discharge, the electrode is moved to cause discharge using an unused part.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un tube à décharge silencieux, qui est durable, consomme peu d'énergie et présente une structure dans laquelle un tube interne est disposé dans un tube externe. Le tube à décharge silencieux comprend une enveloppe à décharge comportant un tube externe qui renferme un tube interne, un gaz de refoulement étant hermétiquement emprisonné dans l'espace délimité par les deux tubes. Une électrode externe est disposée sur la face extérieure du tube externe et une électrode interne est disposée sur la face intérieure du tube interne. L'une des électrodes s'étend sur toute la périphérie du tube tandis que l'autre électrode s'étend sur une partie de ladite périphérie, ce qui provoque une décharge au niveau d'une partie de la périphérie du tube. A la fin de la vie de la décharge, l'électrode est déplacée pour provoquer une décharge sur une partie non utilisée.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>